`profit paid out` MEANS `An activity during a supervisory measure` WITH
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS TRUE
    `takes on more reinsurance` IS FALSE
    `buys back its own shares` IS FALSE
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity` IS FALSE
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS FALSE
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS FALSE
`more reinsurance taken` MEANS `An activity during a supervisory measure` WITH
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS FALSE
    `takes on more reinsurance` IS TRUE
    `buys back its own shares` IS FALSE
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity` IS FALSE
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS FALSE
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS FALSE
`shares bought back` MEANS `An activity during a supervisory measure` WITH
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS FALSE
    `takes on more reinsurance` IS FALSE
    `buys back its own shares` IS TRUE
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity` IS FALSE
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS FALSE
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS FALSE
`scope widened` MEANS `An activity during a supervisory measure` WITH
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS FALSE
    `takes on more reinsurance` IS FALSE
    `buys back its own shares` IS FALSE
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity` IS TRUE
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS FALSE
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS FALSE
`a company founded` MEANS `An activity during a supervisory measure` WITH
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS FALSE
    `takes on more reinsurance` IS FALSE
    `buys back its own shares` IS FALSE
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity` IS FALSE
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS TRUE
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS FALSE
`a high-risk investment` MEANS `An activity during a supervisory measure` WITH
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS FALSE
    `takes on more reinsurance` IS FALSE
    `buys back its own shares` IS FALSE
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity` IS FALSE
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS FALSE
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS TRUE
`ordinary business` MEANS `An activity during a supervisory measure` WITH
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS FALSE
    `takes on more reinsurance` IS FALSE
    `buys back its own shares` IS FALSE
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity` IS FALSE
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS FALSE
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 111(3): the activity is prohibited during improvement measures` `profit paid out` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 111(3): the activity is prohibited during improvement measures` `more reinsurance taken` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 111(3): the activity is prohibited during improvement measures` `shares bought back` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 112(5): the activity is prohibited during early intervention` `shares bought back` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 112(5): the activity is prohibited during early intervention` `scope widened` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 112(5): the activity is prohibited during early intervention` `a company founded` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 113(7): the activity is prohibited during control` `a company founded` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 113(7): the activity is prohibited during control` `a high-risk investment` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 113(7): the activity is prohibited during control` `ordinary business` (YMD 2031 1 1))
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 113(7): the activity is prohibited during control` `a company founded` (YMD 2030 12 31))
-- the same activity, the same day 1 June 2029: a V1 question says the control rule is in force, a V2 question says not
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 113(7): the activity is prohibited during control` `a company founded` (YMD 2029 6 1))
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 113(7): the activity is prohibited during control` `a company founded` (YMD 2029 6 1))

`a ratio at the early-intervention level` MEANS `A supervisory measure` WITH
    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires early intervention` IS TRUE
    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires control` IS FALSE
    `improvement measures were applied for 12 continuous months without restoring the ratio` IS FALSE
    `date of the Ministry of Finance's order` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the insurer built and reported its remedial plan` IS NOTHING
    `date the insurer hired an independent auditor` IS NOTHING
    `date the ratio was restored` IS NOTHING
    `the restoration was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `a control measure has been applied` IS FALSE
`twelve months of improvement without restoring the ratio` MEANS `A supervisory measure` WITH
    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires early intervention` IS FALSE
    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires control` IS FALSE
    `improvement measures were applied for 12 continuous months without restoring the ratio` IS TRUE
    `date of the Ministry of Finance's order` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the insurer built and reported its remedial plan` IS NOTHING
    `date the insurer hired an independent auditor` IS NOTHING
    `date the ratio was restored` IS NOTHING
    `the restoration was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `a control measure has been applied` IS FALSE
