    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires control` IS FALSE
    `improvement measures were applied for 12 continuous months without restoring the ratio` IS FALSE
    `date of the Ministry of Finance's order` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the insurer built and reported its remedial plan` IS NOTHING
    `date the insurer hired an independent auditor` IS NOTHING
