#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 112(1): the Ministry of Finance issues an early intervention order` `twelve months of improvement without restoring the ratio` (YMD 2031 1 1))
