`assets short at the fourth rank` MEANS `A bankruptcy distribution` WITH
    `assets to be divided` IS 100
    `bankruptcy costs` IS 10
    `wages, severance, social and health insurance owed to employees` IS 20
    `claims for compensation or payment already accepted, surrender values, account values or premium refunds` IS 50
    `obligations to the State, unsecured debts on the list, and secured debts not covered by the security` IS 40
    `claims of the owners, members and shareholders` IS 30
`assets short at the first rank` MEANS `A bankruptcy distribution` WITH
    `assets to be divided` IS 5
    `bankruptcy costs` IS 10
    `wages, severance, social and health insurance owed to employees` IS 20
    `claims for compensation or payment already accepted, surrender values, account values or premium refunds` IS 0
    `obligations to the State, unsecured debts on the list, and secured debts not covered by the security` IS 0
    `claims of the owners, members and shareholders` IS 0
`assets exactly covering the third rank` MEANS `A bankruptcy distribution` WITH
    `assets to be divided` IS 80
    `bankruptcy costs` IS 10
    `wages, severance, social and health insurance owed to employees` IS 20
    `claims for compensation or payment already accepted, surrender values, account values or premium refunds` IS 50
    `obligations to the State, unsecured debts on the list, and secured debts not covered by the security` IS 40
    `claims of the owners, members and shareholders` IS 0
`plenty of assets` MEANS `A bankruptcy distribution` WITH
    `assets to be divided` IS 1000
    `bankruptcy costs` IS 10
    `wages, severance, social and health insurance owed to employees` IS 0
    `claims for compensation or payment already accepted, surrender values, account values or premium refunds` IS 0
    `obligations to the State, unsecured debts on the list, and secured debts not covered by the security` IS 0
    `claims of the owners, members and shareholders` IS 30
