`a regular item on Monday 3 March 2025` MEANS `A disclosure event` WITH
    `kind` IS `regular information (Dieu 119)`
    `date the period for sending the report ended, or the event occurred` IS YMD 2025 3 3
    `date the information was published on the insurer's website` IS YMD 2025 3 12
    `date the insurer notified the Ministry of Finance of what it published` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the insurer is a public company` IS FALSE
`an unusual item on Friday 7 March 2025` MEANS `A disclosure event` WITH
    `kind` IS `unusual information (Dieu 120)`
    `date the period for sending the report ended, or the event occurred` IS YMD 2025 3 7
    `date the information was published on the insurer's website` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the insurer notified the Ministry of Finance of what it published` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the insurer is a public company` IS FALSE
`a periodic item on Monday 3 March 2025` MEANS `A disclosure event` WITH
    `kind` IS `periodic information (Dieu 118)`
    `date the period for sending the report ended, or the event occurred` IS YMD 2025 3 3
    `date the information was published on the insurer's website` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the insurer notified the Ministry of Finance of what it published` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the insurer is a public company` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 117(2): the last day to publish the information` `a regular item on Monday 3 March 2025` EMPTY EQUALS YMD 2025 3 12
#ASSERT `Dieu 117(2): the last day to publish the information` `a periodic item on Monday 3 March 2025` EMPTY EQUALS YMD 2025 3 12
#ASSERT `Dieu 117(2): the last day to publish the information` `a regular item on Monday 3 March 2025` (LIST YMD 2025 3 5) EQUALS YMD 2025 3 13
#ASSERT `Dieu 117(2): the last day to publish the information` `an unusual item on Friday 7 March 2025` EMPTY EQUALS YMD 2025 3 12
-- Dieu 117(3) is repealed from V2: the later vintages answer that it does not exist.
