`a holder rising to exactly ten percent` MEANS `A transfer of shares` WITH
    `holding before as a share of charter capital` IS 9%
    `holding after as a share of charter capital` IS 10%
`a holder falling below ten percent` MEANS `A transfer of shares` WITH
    `holding before as a share of charter capital` IS 10%
    `holding after as a share of charter capital` IS 9.9%
`a holder moving between five and eight percent` MEANS `A transfer of shares` WITH
    `holding before as a share of charter capital` IS 5%
    `holding after as a share of charter capital` IS 8%
`a holder moving between twelve and fifteen percent` MEANS `A transfer of shares` WITH
    `holding before as a share of charter capital` IS 12%
    `holding after as a share of charter capital` IS 15%
#ASSERT `Dieu 120(1)(dd): the transfer of shares is unusual information` `a holder rising to exactly ten percent`
#ASSERT `Dieu 120(1)(dd): the transfer of shares is unusual information` `a holder falling below ten percent`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 120(1)(dd): the transfer of shares is unusual information` `a holder moving between five and eight percent`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 120(1)(dd): the transfer of shares is unusual information` `a holder moving between twelve and fifteen percent`
`a loss of exactly ten percent of equity` MEANS `A loss of property` WITH
    `value of the loss` IS 10_000_000_000
    `owners' equity` IS 100_000_000_000
`a loss just under ten percent of equity` MEANS `A loss of property` WITH
    `value of the loss` IS 9_999_999_999
    `owners' equity` IS 100_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 120(1)(m): the loss of property is unusual information` `a loss of exactly ten percent of equity`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 120(1)(m): the loss of property is unusual information` `a loss just under ten percent of equity`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 120(2): the Minister of Finance's detail of unusual information under Dieu 120(1)(k) and (l)`
